# Paste-in close artifacts. A one-time snippet carrying a stage's picks and the whole
# race calendar, regenerated on demand and never committed. The generator that writes
# these is not in the repo; see the close-stage section in CLAUDE.md.
close-stage-*.snippet.js

# Local wrangler cache. Created by `npx wrangler deploy`, machine-specific, never committed.
.wrangler/

# Machine-readable close payloads, regenerated on demand alongside the snippet.
close-stage-*.payload.json

# Dev-only tooling for the guest access gate. The boards are static HTML and ship
# nothing from here; node_modules is machine-specific and never committed.
node_modules/
package-lock.json
firebase-debug.log
firestore-debug.log
